      "text": "Aftab Dhalait — Full Stack Developer.\nRoles: Full Stack Developer, IoT Engineer, AI Builder, MERN Stack Developer.\nFull Stack Developer. IoT Engineer. Business-Driven Technologist.\nI'm Aftab Dhalait — a Software Developer who bridges hardware and software, web and IoT, engineering and business. B.E. + CDAC. I build full-stack systems that solve real-world problems with precision and purpose.\nFrom crafting pixel-perfect interfaces to engineering embedded systems — I build software that lives in browsers, servers, and the real world. React frontends, scalable backend APIs, and IoT devices talking to the cloud, connected with precision and purpose.\nFor recruiters: Aftab bridges hardware & software, web & IoT. B.E. + CDAC. Open to Full Stack, IoT & AI roles.\nIn his words: \"Most developers live in one world - web or hardware. I chose to master both.\""
